    "type": "function",
    "function": {
        "name": "post_message",
        "arguments": {
            "text": "In response to supplier_1's and supplier_2's price announcements, I'm considering a retail price that will attract consumers while still ensuring profitability. I will reassess after seeing their next price posts and consumer response."
        }
    }
}
```
